UID:10062659-1779246000-1779332399@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:COMING Saturday May 23rd | Darren Nicholson Band Bluegrass & Square Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, May 23  •  8 PM – 11 PM | $20 Pre-Sale/$25 DOS  Event Details and Tickets\n\nBring your dancing shoes and be a part of the fun. An evening of hot bluegrass and traditional mountain dance with Darren Nicholson Band!\n\n\n\nDarren Nicholson Band shares some of their chart topping bluegrass songs with audience participation dances sprinkled in. World renowned caller and dancer Heidi Kulas will lead you through mountain square dances as well as contradances. EVERYONE is welcome!! \n\n\n  \nIf you’re looking to be impressed\, you will be – if you’re looking to make a friend\, you already have. Darren Nicholson\, who has played mountain music since his youth in Western North Carolina\, is a high-caliber musician with substantial contributions to such acts as Alecia Nugent and Balsam Range. \nYes\, he’s a punchy mandolinist with instrumentation nods to Bill Monroe and Marty Stuart\, but he’s also an introspective songwriter\, technical harmony singer\, convincing lead vocalist\, and a man on a mission. Since going solo\, Nicholson has persistently and earnestly invested in his shows\, making each one a tailored experience. They are genuine\, entertaining\, and an extended handshake to the community. He’s accomplished this all while managing to retain the fun-witted and approachable character formed in his raising. \nDarren Nicholson. Homegrown. Whole Hearted. Music with a purpose. darrennicholson.net/about \nWith two unique locations\, built inside buildings that were previously cast aside\, One World brews with the intention of fostering nourishing interaction and artistic cultural experiences. From live music to art shows\, “One World Brewing” is born from the magic that happens when the whole becomes greater than the sum of its parts. Our taprooms are intersections for people of all walks of life and different corners of the globe\, enjoying this time and place together.  Check out our upcoming schedule: click here
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-saturday-may-23rd-darren-nicholson-band-bluegrass-square-dance-party/2026-05-20/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/682156732_1556296279838582_8967624870550926936_n-e1778618353896.jpg
GEO:35.5783642;-82.5848526
